      "value": "@{5adf7c5544b24b6ef7cb0f25|full_name}: I think the problem here lies between casting and conversion. I dont know if were able to \"explicitly cast\" in Udon however. More on that here:\nhttps://stackoverflow.com/questions/15394032/difference-between-casting-and-using-the-convert-to-method",
